INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('bw8-128','Dowsing Machine','Trainer','128','Rare ACE','Ryo Ueda',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/bw8/128.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/bw8/128_hires.png"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Item","ACE SPEC"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Discard 2 cards from your hand. (If you can''t discard 2 cards, you can''t play this card.) Put a Trainer card from your discard pile into your hand.","You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).","You can''t have more than 1 ACE SPEC card in your deck."]','bw8');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('bw8-129','Scramble Switch','Trainer','129','Rare ACE','5ban Graphics',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/bw8/129.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/bw8/129_hires.png"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Item","ACE SPEC"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Switch your Active Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon. Then, you may move as many Energy attached to the old Active Pokémon to the new Active Pokémon as you like.","You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).","You can''t have more than 1 ACE SPEC card in your deck."]','bw8');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('bw8-130','Victory Piece','Trainer','130','Rare ACE','5ban Graphics',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/bw8/130.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/bw8/130_hires.png"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Pokémon Tool","ACE SPEC"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn''t already have a Pokémon Tool attached to it.","If this card is attached to Victini-EX, Victini-EX can use its attacks regardless of the amount or type of Energy attached to it.","You may play as many Item cards as you like during your turn (before your attack).","You can''t have more than 1 ACE SPEC card in your deck."]','bw8');
