INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('gym1-2','Brock''s Rhydon','Pokémon','2','Rare Holo','Ken Sugimori',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/gym1/2.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/gym1/2_hires.png"}',NULL,'80','38','["Stage 1"]','["Fighting"]','Brock''s Rhyhorn','["Rhyperior"]','[{"name":"Bench Guard","text":"As long as Brock''s Rhydon is Benched, whenever 1 of your Benched Pokémon is damaged, you may do 10 of that damage to Brock''s Rhydon instead. (If more than 1 of your Benched Pokémon is damaged at the same time, you may use this power once for each of them.)","type":"Pokémon Power"}]','[{"name":"Lariat","cost":["Fighting","Fighting","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":4,"damage":"70","text":"Flip a coin. If tails, this attack does nothing."}]','[{"type":"Grass","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Lightning","value":"-30"}]','["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',3,'[112]',NULL,NULL,'gym1');
