INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm10-175','Green''s Exploration','Trainer','175','Uncommon','Naoki Saito',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm10/175.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm10/175_hires.png"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Supporter"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["You can play this card only if you have no Pokémon with Abilities in play.","Search your deck for up to 2 Trainer cards, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.","You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack)."]','sm10');
