INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm115-51','Bill''s Analysis','Trainer','51','Rare','Naoki Saito',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm115/51.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm115/51_hires.png"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Supporter"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Look at the top 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal up to 2 Trainer cards you find there and put them into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.","You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack)."]','sm115');
