INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm8-189','Sightseer','Trainer','189','Uncommon','Naoki Saito',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm8/189.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm8/189_hires.png"}',NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Supporter"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["You may discard any number of cards from your hand. Then, draw cards until you have 5 cards in your hand. If you can''t draw any cards in this way, you can''t play this card.","You may play only 1 Supporter card during your turn (before your attack)."]','sm8');
