INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-84','Alolan Muk','Pokémon','84','Rare','Midori Harada','While it''s unexpectedly quiet and friendly, if it''s not fed any trash for a while, it will smash its Trainer''s furnishings and eat up the fragments.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/84.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/84_hires.png"}',NULL,'120',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Darkness"]','Alolan Grimer',NULL,'[{"name":"Adventurous Appetite","text":"When you play this Pokémon from your hand to evolve 1 of your Pokémon during your turn, you may look at the top 6 cards of your opponent''s deck and discard any number of Item cards you find there. Your opponent shuffles the other cards back into their deck.","type":"Ability"}]','[{"name":"Gunk Shot","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"80","text":"Your opponent''s Active Pokémon is now Poisoned."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',3,'[89]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-85','Tyranitar','Pokémon','85','Rare Holo','Hasuno','If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/85.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/85_hires.png"}',NULL,'170',NULL,'["Stage 2"]','["Darkness"]','Pupitar',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Spinning Tail","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"","text":"This attack does 30 damage to each of your opponent''s Pokémon. (Don''t apply Weakness and Resistance for Benched Pokémon.)"},{"name":"Bite Off","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":4,"damage":"130+","text":"If your opponent''s Active Pokémon is a Pokémon-GX or a Pokémon-EX, this attack does 100 more damage."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',4,'[248]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-86','Poochyena','Pokémon','86','Common','Ken Sugimori','It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/86.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/86_hires.png"}',NULL,'70',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Darkness"]',NULL,'["Mightyena"]',NULL,'[{"name":"Howl in the Dark","cost":["Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Search your deck for up to 2 Darkness Pokémon, reveal them, and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck."},{"name":"Bite","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"10","text":""}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[261]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-87','Mightyena','Pokémon','87','Rare','kirisAki','It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/87.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/87_hires.png"}',NULL,'100',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Darkness"]','Poochyena',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Bite","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"30","text":""},{"name":"Dark Fang","cost":["Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":2,"damage":"50","text":"Discard a random card from your opponent''s hand."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[262]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-88','Absol','Pokémon','88','Rare Holo','nagimiso','Although it''s said to bring disaster, in actuality, this Pokémon possesses a calm disposition and warns people of any crises that loom.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/88.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/88_hires.png"}',NULL,'100',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Darkness"]',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Dark Ambition","text":"If your opponent''s Active Pokémon is a Basic Pokémon, its Retreat Cost is Colorless more.","type":"Ability"}]','[{"name":"Shadow Seeker","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"30+","text":"This attack does 30 more damage for each Colorless in your opponent''s Active Pokémon''s Retreat Cost."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[359]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-89','Spiritomb','Pokémon','89','Uncommon','HYOGONOSUKE','It was bound to a fissure in an odd keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/89.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/89_hires.png"}',NULL,'70',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Darkness"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Spirit Compressor","cost":["Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Search your deck for up to 4 Pokémon and discard them. Then, shuffle your deck."},{"name":"Spooky Shot","cost":["Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"20","text":""}]',NULL,NULL,'["Colorless"]',1,'[442]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-90','Zorua','Pokémon','90','Common','Naoyo Kimura','To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/90.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/90_hires.png"}',NULL,'60',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Darkness"]',NULL,'["Zoroark"]',NULL,'[{"name":"Hide in Shadows","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Switch this Pokémon with 1 of your Benched Pokémon."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[570]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-91','Zoroark','Pokémon','91','Rare Holo','Masakazu Fukuda','Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/91.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/91_hires.png"}',NULL,'110',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Darkness"]','Zorua',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Taunt","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Switch 1 of your opponent''s Benched Pokémon with their Active Pokémon."},{"name":"Night Punishment","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"20×","text":"This attack does 20 damage for each Pokémon in your discard pile. You can''t do more than 200 damage in this way."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless","Colorless"]',2,'[571]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-92','Vullaby','Pokémon','92','Common','Eri Yamaki','It can''t fly yet and must wait until its wings have developed more. Since it''s still at a playful age, it hops around friskily.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/92.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/92_hires.png"}',NULL,'60',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Darkness"]',NULL,'["Mandibuzz"]',NULL,'[{"name":"Collect","cost":["Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Draw a card."},{"name":"Corkscrew Punch","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"10","text":""}]','[{"type":"Lightning","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[629]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-93','Mandibuzz','Pokémon','93','Rare','Ayaka Yoshida','It circles in the sky, keeping a keen eye out for Pokémon in a weakened state. Its choicest food is Cubone.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/93.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/93_hires.png"}',NULL,'120',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Darkness"]','Vullaby',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Trash Crash","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Discard an Item card from your hand. If you do, this attack does 60 damage to 1 of your opponent''s Pokémon. This damage isn''t affected by Weakness or Resistance."},{"name":"Brave Bird","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"120","text":"This Pokémon does 30 damage to itself."}]','[{"type":"Lightning","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless","Colorless"]',2,'[630]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-94','Pangoro','Pokémon','94','Rare','Satoshi Shirai','From the slight twitches of its bamboo leaf, it deduces its opponent''s movements. It''s eager to tussle but kindhearted toward its companions.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/94.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/94_hires.png"}',NULL,'140',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Darkness"]','Pancham',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Tighten Up","cost":["Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"60","text":"Your opponent discards 2 cards from their hand."},{"name":"Tantrum","cost":["Darkness","Darkness","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":4,"damage":"170","text":"This Pokémon is now Confused."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Psychic","value":"-20"}]','["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',4,'[675]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sm9-95','Yveltal','Pokémon','95','Rare Holo','Misa Tsutsui','When its life comes to an end, it absorbs the life energy of every living thing and turns into a cocoon once more.','{"unlimited":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/95.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sm9/95_hires.png"}',NULL,'110',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Darkness"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Derail","cost":["Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"30","text":"Discard a Special Energy from your opponent''s Active Pokémon."},{"name":"Clutch","cost":["Darkness","Darkness"],"convertedEnergyCost":2,"damage":"60","text":"The Defending Pokémon can''t retreat during your opponent''s next turn."}]','[{"type":"Lightning","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"-20"}]',NULL,NULL,'[717]',NULL,NULL,'sm9');
