INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv2-183','Great Ball','Trainer','183','Common','Studio Bora Inc.',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv2/183.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv2/183_hires.png"}','G',NULL,NULL,'["Item"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Look at the top 7 cards of your deck. You may reveal a Pokémon you find there and put it into your hand. Shuffle the other cards back into your deck.","You may play any number of Item cards during your turn."]','sv2');
