INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv2-188','Super Rod','Trainer','188','Common','Toyste Beach',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv2/188.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv2/188_hires.png"}','G',NULL,NULL,'["Item"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Shuffle up to 3 in any combination of Pokémon and Basic Energy cards from your discard pile into your deck.","You may play any number of Item cards during your turn."]','sv2');
