INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv5-124','Lickitung','Pokémon','124','Common','nisimono','If this Pokémon''s sticky saliva gets on you and you don''t clean it off, an intense itch will set in. The itch won''t go away, either.','{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/124.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/124_hires.png"}','H','100',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Colorless"]',NULL,'["Lickilicky"]',NULL,'[{"name":"Tongue Pull","cost":["Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"","text":"Your opponent reveals their hand. Put up to 2 Basic Pokémon you find there onto your opponent''s Bench."},{"name":"Strength","cost":["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"50","text":""}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]',NULL,'["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',3,'[108]',NULL,NULL,'sv5');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv5-125','Lickilicky','Pokémon','125','Common','kirisAki','Lickilicky''s strange tongue can stretch to many times the length of its body. No one has figured out how Lickilicky''s tongue can stretch so far.','{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/125.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/125_hires.png"}','H','150',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Colorless"]','Lickitung',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Body Slam","cost":["Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":2,"damage":"50","text":"Flip a coin. If heads, your opponent''s Active Pokémon is now Paralyzed."},{"name":"Tonguenado","cost":["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":4,"damage":"70×","text":"Flip 4 coins. This attack does 70 damage for each heads."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]',NULL,'["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',4,'[463]',NULL,NULL,'sv5');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv5-126','Hoothoot','Pokémon','126','Common','ryoma uratsuka','It always stands on one foot. It changes feet so fast, the movement can rarely be seen.','{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/126.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/126_hires.png"}','H','70',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Colorless"]',NULL,'["Noctowl"]',NULL,'[{"name":"Silent Wing","cost":["Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":2,"damage":"20","text":"Your opponent reveals their hand."}]','[{"type":"Lightning","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"-30"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[163]',NULL,NULL,'sv5');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv5-127','Noctowl','Pokémon','127','Common','toi8','Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.','{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/127.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/127_hires.png"}','H','110',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Colorless"]','Hoothoot',NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Talon Hunt","cost":["Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":2,"damage":"70","text":"You may search your deck for up to 2 cards and put them into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck."}]','[{"type":"Lightning","value":"×2"}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"-30"}]','["Colorless"]',1,'[164]',NULL,NULL,'sv5');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv5-128','Dunsparce','Pokémon','128','Common','Sanosuke Sakuma','It creates mazes in dark locations. When spotted, it flees into the ground by digging with its tail.','{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/128.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/128_hires.png"}','H','60',NULL,'["Basic"]','["Colorless"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Gnaw","cost":["Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":1,"damage":"10","text":""},{"name":"Dig","cost":["Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":2,"damage":"30","text":"Flip a coin. If heads, during your opponent''s next turn, prevent all damage from and effects of attacks done to this Pokémon."}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[206]',NULL,NULL,'sv5');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('sv5-129','Dudunsparce','Pokémon','129','Rare','Teeziro','This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles.','{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/129.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/sv5/129_hires.png"}','H','140',NULL,'["Stage 1"]','["Colorless"]','Dunsparce',NULL,'[{"name":"Run Away Draw","text":"Once during your turn, you may draw 3 cards. If you drew any cards in this way, shuffle this Pokémon and all attached cards into your deck.","type":"Ability"}]','[{"name":"Land Crush","cost":["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"90","text":""}]','[{"type":"Fighting","value":"×2"}]',NULL,'["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"]',3,'[982]',NULL,NULL,'sv5');
