INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('swsh12-153','Capturing Aroma','Trainer','153','Uncommon','sadaji',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/153.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/153_hires.png"}','F',NULL,NULL,'["Item"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["Flip a coin. If heads, search your deck for an Evolution Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If tails, search your deck for a Basic Pokémon, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then, shuffle your deck.","You may play any number of Item cards during your turn."]','swsh12');
INSERT INTO "Card" VALUES('swsh12-154','Earthen Seal Stone','Trainer','154','Rare Holo','AYUMI ODASHIMA',NULL,'{"unlimited":"Legal","standard":"Legal","expanded":"Legal"}','{"small":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/154.png","large":"https://images.pokemontcg.io/swsh12/154_hires.png"}','F',NULL,NULL,'["Item","Pokémon Tool"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[{"name":"Star Gravity","cost":["Colorless","Colorless","Colorless"],"convertedEnergyCost":3,"damage":"","text":"Put damage counters on each of your opponent''s Pokémon V until its remaining HP is 100. (You can''t use more than 1 VSTAR Power in a game.)"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'["The Pokémon V this card is attached to can use the VSTAR Power on this card. (You still need the necessary Energy to use this attack.)","You may play any number of Item cards during your turn.","Attach a Pokémon Tool to 1 of your Pokémon that doesn''t already have a Pokémon Tool attached."]','swsh12');
